  "bound": "OPTIMISTIC. Both caveats above inflate v1 and neither is subtractable from these numbers: the head trained at these locations, and the labels were prefilled with its own suggestions. Every precision here is an upper bound on what the same cut buys at a FRESH location, and the honest use of this record is as a ceiling, not an estimate.",
